          "bride_name": "Ananya Sharma",
          "bride_parents": "D/o Mr. Rajesh & Mrs. Sunita Sharma",
          "bride_description": "A free spirit wrapped in grace, Ananya moves through life with quiet confidence, an infectious laugh, and a kindness that makes everyone around her feel at home.",
